{"seq":4,"slug":"de-gaulle-foreign-policy","title":"夏尔·戴高乐：戴高乐主义外交","stage":"DONE","category":"charles-de-gaulle","categoryLabel":"夏尔·戴高乐","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":2.5,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/13_charles-de-gaulle/4_de-gaulle-foreign-policy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"戴高乐主义外交-在两极世界中重建法国的大国地位\">戴高乐主义外交：在两极世界中重建法国的大国地位</h1><p>1958 年戴高乐重返权力时，法国刚刚在印度支那战败、深陷阿尔及利亚战争，国际地位被压缩在美苏两极格局的边缘。十一年后他离任时，法国已退出北约军事一体化指挥、建成独立核力量、与西德缔结和解条约、率先承认中华人民共和国，并把&quot;缓和、谅解、合作&quot;的旗帜插到了莫斯科。这一系列看似矛盾、实则连贯的行动，构成了被后世称为&quot;戴高乐主义&quot;（gaullisme）的外交体系。</p>\n<p>戴高乐主义的核心不是某种意识形态，而是一种对法国本质的执念：他认为&quot;伟大&quot;（grandeur）是法国与生俱来的属性，法国唯有作为一个骄傲、主权完整、独立自主的大国，平等地参与世界事务，才算名副其实。围绕这一信念，他构建起一套以&quot;民族独立&quot;为最高原则的外交逻辑——拒绝任何超国家机构、盟友或集团强加于法国的决定。</p>\n<p>本 hub 从三个维度梳理这套外交遗产。第一章聚焦&quot;伟大政治&quot;的理论内核与最具标志性的两次行动：建设独立核威慑力量（force de frappe），以及 1966 年退出北约军事指挥体系。第二章转向欧洲与东西方平衡，考察戴高乐如何用&quot;空椅子危机&quot;和两次否决英国入欧来塑造一个&quot;民族国家的欧洲&quot;，又如何借《爱丽舍条约》锚定法德轴心、向苏东集团伸出橄榄枝。第三章追踪戴高乐外交的全球延伸：从蒙特利尔阳台上的&quot;自由魁北克万岁&quot;，到承认北京、批评越战、对以色列实施武器禁运。</p>\n<p>本 hub 力求以严谨、平衡、可溯源的方式呈现这段历史：标注确切的日期、地点、人物与原始文献，既呈现戴高乐外交的雄心与成就，也不回避其代价与争议。戴高乐主义并非毫无内在张力——独立与孤立常常一线之隔，民族骄傲与现实国力之间始终存在落差。理解这些张力，才能理解为什么半个多世纪后，从核威慑到&quot;战略自主&quot;，戴高乐留下的命题仍在塑造着法国乃至欧洲的外交辩论。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grandeur-and-independence","title":"民族独立与大国地位：戴高乐外交的理论与利器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/grandeur-and-independence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-doctrine-of-grandeur","title":"伟大政治：戴高乐外交的思想内核","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/grandeur-and-independence/the-doctrine-of-grandeur"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nuclear-deterrent-force-de-frappe","title":"独立核威慑：打击力量（force de frappe）的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/grandeur-and-independence/nuclear-deterrent-force-de-frappe"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nato-withdrawal-1966","title":"1966 年退出北约军事一体化指挥","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/grandeur-and-independence/nato-withdrawal-1966"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"europe-and-the-east-west-axis","title":"欧洲建设与东西方平衡：祖国的欧洲与跨越铁幕的手","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/europe-and-the-east-west-axis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"empty-chair-and-uk-veto","title":"空椅子危机与两度否决英国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/europe-and-the-east-west-axis/empty-chair-and-uk-veto"},{"seq":2,"slug":"franco-german-elysee-treaty","title":"《爱丽舍条约》：法德和解与欧洲的引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/europe-and-the-east-west-axis/franco-german-elysee-treaty"},{"seq":3,"slug":"detente-with-the-eastern-bloc","title":"对苏东集团的缓和：从大西洋到乌拉尔的欧洲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/europe-and-the-east-west-axis/detente-with-the-eastern-bloc"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"third-world-and-global-reach","title":"第三世界与全球影响：在两极之外发出声音","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/third-world-and-global-reach","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quebec-and-latin-america","title":"自由魁北克与拉丁美洲：挑战美国的后院","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/third-world-and-global-reach/quebec-and-latin-america"},{"seq":2,"slug":"middle-east-and-china-recognition","title":"承认北京、批评越战与中东转向","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/charles-de-gaulle/de-gaulle-foreign-policy/third-world-and-global-reach/middle-east-and-china-recognition"}]}]}